      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Destination Handover, Odometer Sign-Off &amp; Joint Condition Inspection for bike transport from coimbatore to chennai</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><h3>Destination Delivery Handover Procedure for Two‑Wheeler &amp; Motorcycle</h3>
<p>When a two‑wheeler or motorcycle reaches its final destination, a structured handover ensures that the vehicle is received in the exact condition documented at pickup. The process is built around three core verification pillars: daylight condition re‑inspection, odometer cross‑check, and a signed condition sign‑off.</p>
<p>Each pillar is designed to protect both the consignor and the consignee from disputes and to maintain a transparent record of the vehicle’s journey.</p>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
