    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Daylight Condition Re‑inspection:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The receiving party conducts a visual inspection under natural daylight to eliminate shadows or artificial lighting that could obscure damage. Inspectors compare the vehicle’s current state with the high‑resolution pickup photographs taken at origin. Any new scratches, dents, or missing parts are noted, photographed, and logged immediately.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 10px;">
