</div>
<p>This comprehensive handover protocol minimizes risk, clarifies responsibility, and creates a reliable record that can be referenced in case of disputes. By adhering to these steps, logistics partners guarantee that two‑wheelers and motorcycles are delivered exactly as promised, preserving trust and operational efficiency.</p></div>
