    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Enclosed carriers provide a completely enclosed environment for your bike, shielding it from flying rocks, rain, dust, and other environmental factors. This ensures your bike remains pristine throughout the journey.</p>
